Input: {"question": "What is the genre of the film \"Bright Lights\"?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0485-53896a80bcfa:d00", "start": 0, "end": 132, "text": "Bright Lights (1928 film) Bright Lights is a 1928 silent cartoon short by Walt Disney Productions featuring Oswald the Lucky Rabbit."}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0485-53896a80bcfa:d00", "start": 133, "end": 226, "text": "It is among the few short films of the series Disney worked on before leaving that same year."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0485-53896a80bcfa:d00", "start": 227, "end": 324, "text": "Previously in 1927, Oswald had an oval face, a chubbier waist, and pants with a single suspender."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0485-53896a80bcfa:d00", "start": 325, "end": 408, "text": "By 1928, he's given a makeover, having a rounder head, a slimmer waist, and shorts."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0485-53896a80bcfa:d00", "start": 409, "end": 513, "text": "Despite this change, the rabbit's 1927 appearance would still appear on the title cards until \"High Up\"."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0485-53896a80bcfa:d00", "start": 514, "end": 561, "text": "His shorts would be his only outfit until 1930."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0485-53896a80bcfa:d00", "start": 562, "end": 577, "text": "A show composed"}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0485-53896a80bcfa:d01", "start": 0, "end": 126, "text": "Bright Lights (1928 film) Bright Lights is a 1928 romantic drama by Walt Disney Productions featuring Oswald the Lucky Rabbit."}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0485-53896a80bcfa:d01", "start": 127, "end": 220, "text": "It is among the few short films of the series Disney worked on before leaving that same year."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0485-53896a80bcfa:d01", "start": 221, "end":