y 14, 2016."}, "D4S2": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0485-53896a80bcfa:d03", "start": 17, "end": 159, "text": "It was also screened at the Telluride Film Festival on September 3, 2016 and at the Hot Springs Documentary Film Festival on October 14, 2016."}, "D4S3": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0485-53896a80bcfa:d03", "start": 160, "end": 269, "text": "It went on to screen at the New York Film Festival on October 10, 2016 and the AFI Fest on November 13, 2016."}, "D4S4": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0485-53896a80bcfa:d03", "start": 270, "end": 443, "text": "The documentary was to premiere on HBO in March 2017, but after the actresses' deaths in late December 2016, the network announced that they were reconsidering the air date."}, "D4S5": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0485-53896a80bcfa:d03", "start": 444, "end": 525, "text": "The decision was subsequently made to air the premiere on HBO on January 7, 2017."}, "D4S6": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0485-53896a80bcfa:d03", "start": 526, "end": 557, "text": "\"Bright Lights: Starring Carrie"}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "ramdocs-0485-53896a80bcfa:d00", "card_id": "ramdocs-0485-53896a80bcfa:d00:c0", "entity": "Bright Lights", "scope": "film", "claim": "The genre of the film \"Bright Lights\" is cartoon.", "answer": "cartoon", "quote": "Bright Lights (1928 film) Bright Lights is a 1928 silent cartoon short by Walt Disney Productions featuring Oswald the Lucky Rabbit.", "original_document_number": 1}, {"doc_id": "ramdocs-0485-53896a80bcfa:d01", "card_id": "ramdocs-0485-53896a80bcfa:d01:c0", "entity": "Bright Lights", "scope": "film", "claim": "The genre of the film \"Bright Lights\" is romantic drama.", "answer": "romantic drama", "quote": "Bright Lights (1928 film) Bright Lights is a 1928 romantic drama by Walt Disney Productions featuring Oswald the Lucky Rabbit.", "original_document_number": 2}, {"doc_id": "ramdocs-0485-53896a80bcfa:d02", "card_id": "ramdoc